# CORE_UX — components

Generic `<core-*>` presentation on **CORE_JS** only. Details: `ai-instructions/components.md`, `ai-instructions/README.md`.

## Role (mandatory)

- Reusable UI kit — **no business logic**, **no `$svc('ajax')`**, no app routes/entities.
- Renders with **`ui_render()`** (pure DOM) — **no Handlebars** in this repo.
- Lifecycle/bindings: follow `CORE_JS/.cursor/rules/core-js-components.mdc` (`Core_HTMLElement` base).

## Base classes

| Class | Use |
|-------|-----|
| `Core_UXElement` | Default base |
| `Core_UXSlotElement` | Preserves light-DOM children (modal, card, …) |
| `Core_UXFormControl` | Labelled inputs |

## Conventions

- Tag names: `core-<name>` (kebab-case).
- Register: `registerCoreComponent('core-<name>', Class)` at module bottom.
- Events: `bindDelegated()` / `bindUI()` — never manual `addEventListener` in `ui_toFunctional`.
- Boolean attrs: `hasBoolAttr`; JSON attrs: `parseJsonAttr`.
- DOM: `createElement({ text })` for user/API strings; `trustedHtml` / `mountTrustedHtml` for author markup only.

## Styles & doc (same change set)

- Tailwind in `styles/core-ux.css` — **core-* token utilities only** — see `core-ux-theming.mdc`.
- **Mandatory:** update `doc/components/core-<name>.html` + `doc/assets/sidebar.js` when adding/changing tags.

## App consumption

Apps import subsets — not `index.js` barrel. See `ai-instructions/app-integration.md`.
